  m_text: "RAT is a first person stealth based strategy where the player controls
    a plague-ridden rat with the goal of collapsing human society. Through direct
    contact, contagion in the environment will build up and spread throughout the
    surroundings. Use a small, furry catalyst to cause the ultimate domino effect.\r\n\r\nWhile
    the rat is adept at scurrying away from danger, the player will help the rat
    adapt to increasing environmental dangers and human vigilance by harnessing the
    plague it spreads to mutate and gain new abilities.\r\n\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
